{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/grafluent\/extensions"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"Grafluent"}],"title":"Extensions Across Modules"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A type’s own page lists only the members of its own module. Each page here collects the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"members that every other module adds to one type.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"The members each module adds to types declared in another module, by extended type.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"GraphProtocols","anchor":"GraphProtocols","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-BidirectionalDirectedGraph-Extensions","doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-DirectedGraph-Extensions","doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-DirectedHypergraph-Extensions","doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-Graph-Extensions","doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-Hypergraph-Extensions","doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-MutableDirectedGraph-Extensions","doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-MutableGraph-Extensions"]},{"title":"DirectedAcyclicGraphModule","anchor":"DirectedAcyclicGraphModule","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/DirectedAcyclicGraphModule-DirectedAcyclicGraph-Extensions"]},{"title":"Trees","anchor":"Trees","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/Trees-Arborescence-Extensions","doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/Trees-RootedTree-Extensions","doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/Trees-Tree-Extensions"]},{"title":"BipartiteGraphs","anchor":"Bipart